<para>Since the gripper has no position feedback its position is initially unknown. For this reason we try to retrieve the latest commanded position from a buffer file using <ref refid="classbioscara__hardware__drivers_1_1BaseGripper_1a16aae28dcd08f034da662577719b5c1b" kindref="member">retrieve_last_position()</ref>. If this fails the <ref refid="classbioscara__hardware__drivers_1_1BaseGripper_1a132a5ee7e7aa2cc0f7b3527fbb5d23bd" kindref="member">_backup_init_pos</ref> is used. <simplesect kind="return"><para><ref refid="namespacebioscara__hardware__drivers_1a1d009df6593ed79588fb4ae11be3e7c5ae0aa021e21dddbd6d8cecec71e9cf564" kindref="member">err_type_t::OK</ref> </para>
